      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you compare the thermal conductivity and heat dissipation rates of ceramic brake pads versus semi-metallic pads during high-speed deceleration cycles? I'm specifically looking at how heat soak affects the friction coefficient over sustained heavy braking periods.",
